      <pdf:Keywords>8-bit Microcontroller; ATmega328/P; High performance; low power; advanced RISC Architecture; high endurance; non-volatile memory segment; EEPROM; In-system self-programmable flash; Internal SRAM; Atmel QTouch library support; capacitive touch; 64 sense channels; 8-bit and 16-bit Timer/counter; PWM; 10-bit ADC; USART; SPI; I2C; WDT; AC; POR"</pdf:Keywords>
